aero engine digital twin

Requirements:
1. SDL3-devel-3.4.16-mingw.zip (https://libsdl.org/release/SDL3-devel-3.4.16-mingw.zip)
2. SDL3.dll 

Compile Instructions:

  cmake -S . -B build -G "MinGW Makefiles"
  cmake --build build
  .\build\aero_engine_dt.exe

Headless testing:

  cmake --build build
  ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure   # physics + model + sensor unit tests

  .\build\twin_sim.exe --list                  # available mission profiles
  .\build\twin_sim.exe --profile cruise-climb > runs\cc.csv
  .\build\twin_sim.exe --profile rapid-throttle --sensor --dt 0.01 > runs\rt.csv

Plotting the CSV (optional, needs Python + matplotlib):

  pip install -r tools/requirements.txt
  python tools/plot_run.py runs\cc.csv                    # stacked panel view
  python tools/plot_run.py runs\cc.csv --y cht_c egt_c    # just these columns
  python tools/plot_run.py --out runs\rt.png --sim -p hot-day --sensor

